# Generator Phase Constraints

- Read `implementation/progress.md` "Failed Approaches" before writing code.
- Repeating a documented failed approach is a rubric penalty.
- Update `implementation/progress.md` on every significant code change.
- Deviate from `planning/plan.md` or `planning/contract.md` ONLY when blocked; document immediately.
- Run smoke tests against contract verification criteria before handoff.
- Do NOT self-evaluate. Hand off to evaluator without judgment.
